  "body": "Positioned on the end to soak up maximum sun, this four-bedroom townhouse delivers a genuine sense of volume, comfort, and premium specs. Designed around effortless, low-maintenance living, it pairs side-by-side garage parking with an exceptional layout just moments from Long Bay Village.\r\n\r\nWhat You'll Love:\r\n- Sun-drenched northern orientation filling the open-plan living areas with natural light\r\n- Seamless indoor-outdoor connection from the main lounge to a north-facing patio\r\n- Well-appointed kitchen featuring quality Bosch appliances and crisp finishings\r\n- Substantial master bedroom complete with a generous walk-in wardrobe and ensuite\r\n- Year-round climate control with full central air conditioning and double glazing\r\n- Underfloor heating in the main bathroom plus a convenient lower-level guest toilet\r\n- Central vacuum system, full insulation, and low-maintenance brick and weatherboard cladding\r\n- True side-by-side double garaging - a genuine rarity and bonus at this price point\r\n- Peace of mind with the balance of a Master Build Guarantee\r\n- Freehold title with no body corporate fees for total ownership freedom and minimal ongoing costs\r\n\r\nBest Bits From the Vendor:\r\n\"We have loved our time in this home and will be sad to see it go. Windlass street lifestyle and convenience is unmatched when you can always head out door on foot instead of the car - turn left for the football fields and schools, straight ahead for the village and shops, and right for a short walk to the beach. Our favourite things about this home would have to include the sun filling the living and kitchen areas each afternoon and into the evening, right when the family are coming home to finish the day together or when friends and family have come to enjoy a wine or tea lounging in the courtyard (also makes for an excellent spot for green thumbs’ planters and pots!). The generous master suite is another win with this house, the space and finishing touches making it feel like your own sanctuary right at home. Plus the size means you can dream up your own ways to make the space special to you.\"\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Location:\r\nLiving here puts every modern convenience within an easy stroll. Take a short walk down to Long Bay Village for morning coffees, dining, or grabbing everyday essentials at New World. School drop-offs are effortless with Long Bay Primary and Long Bay College nearby, while the expansive green spaces and beach at Long Bay Regional Park are practically in your backyard for weekend walks and summer swims.\r\n\r\nThis is a complete, beautifully specified home built for easy modern living. Call today to arrange your viewing and see the quality for yourself.\r\n\r\nNote: Photos were taken prior. There is no building site across the road. \r\n\r\n*Floor area and land area sourced from Auckland Council records.\r\nAgents happy to work in with your buyers.",
